  "body": "Over $500,000 has been poured into a comprehensive, high-end renovation of this coastal sanctuary-and with the property now vacant, you can move straight in and celebrate Christmas by the beach! From the stunning new kitchen with a gas hob to brand-new laminate flooring, plush carpet, fresh interior paint, and beautifully updated bathrooms, absolute quality is evident at every turn. There is literally nothing left to do but unpack and enjoy.\r\nThe top floor immediately steals the show with sweeping sea and bush views. Kick back on the oversized deck and watch the sunrise over the water, while inside, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and main living area creates a welcoming heart to the home. A spacious master suite and convenient guest powder room complete this level.\r\nDownstairs offers fantastic versatility, featuring a cosy second lounge leading to three generous bedrooms, each opening directly onto the lower deck. A stylish renovated family bathroom with a bathtub and a freshly refurbished laundry complete this level, leading out to a generous lawn and peaceful established gardens framed by lush native greenery.\r\nOffered to the market for the first time in 25 years, 503 Hibiscus Coast Highway sits tucked well back from the road along a quiet, private driveway. Built with solid brick, weatherboard, and concrete block construction on an expansive 883sqm freehold site, it seamlessly combines trusted structural integrity with bright, effortless beach style.\r\nWith vendors who are genuinely motivated to sell, your dream coastal lifestyle is ready for immediate enjoyment. Contact us today for a private viewing and secure your home before the holidays!",
